OL,3,GNEWSAMan with brain tumour hopes for
OL,4,Atreatment abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was told he had at least a
OL,7,Fyear to live after being diagnosed with
OL,8,Fan inoperable brain tumour has said he
OL,9,Fstill hopes to receive experimental
OL,10,Ftreatment abroad.
OL,12,FJack Rawding-Revell, from Glossop in
OL,13,FDerbyshire, said he started with double
OL,14,Fvision earlier this year, and when his
OL,15,Fsymptoms worsened, he was rushed to
OL,16,Fhospital and later given the diagnosis.
OL,18,FBut the 25-year-old told the BBC he is
OL,19,Fexploring options for treatments which
OL,20,Fare not offered on the NHS but are in
OL,21,Ftrial stages in the Netherlands and
OL,22,FSwitzerland.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
