OL,3,GNEWSAMan with brain tumour hopes for
OL,4,Atreatment abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack said: "There's life-prolonging
OL,7,Fmedication out there, so why the hell
OL,8,Fwould you not want to fight this."
